{"id":453,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"A poison wielder with a dastardly personality. Despite such qualities, this species is afforded a measure of popularity due to its peculiar cry and comical features."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Once diluted, its poison becomes medicinal. This Pokémon came into popularity after a pharmaceutical company chose it as a mascot."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It makes frightening noises with its poison-filled cheek sacs. When opponents flinch, Croagunk hits them with a poison jab."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Diamond"],"text":"Its cheeks hold poison sacs. It tries to catch foes off guard to jab them with toxic fingers."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Fluid squeezed from its finger, albeit poisonous, is a significant ingredient in remedies for lower back pain."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"Inflating its poison sacs, it makes an eerie blubbering sound for intimidation."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Anticipation","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon can sense an opposing Pokémon's dangerous moves."},{"name":"Dry Skin","hidden":false,"description":"Restores the Pokémon's HP in rain or when it is hit by Water-type moves. Reduces HP in harsh sunlight, and increases the damage received from Fire-type moves."},{"name":"Poison Touch","hidden":true,"description":"May poison a target when the Pokémon makes contact."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":10,"baseHappiness":100,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":453,"name":"Croagunk","condition":null,"children":[{"id":454,"name":"Toxicroak","condition":"Lv. 37","children":[]}]},"move